{"number":92,"nameArabic":"الليل","nameTransliterated":"Al-Layl","nameTranslated":"The Night","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":21,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"92:1","textAr":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا يَغۡشَىٰ","transliteration":"Waallayli itha yaghsha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"By the night when it covers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"قسم ہے رات کی جبکہ وہ چھا جائے"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"92:2","textAr":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا تَجَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"Waalnnahari itha tajalla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [by] the day when it appears"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور دن کی جبکہ وہ روشن ہو"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"92:3","textAr":"وَمَا خَلَقَ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلۡأُنثَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wama khalaqa alththakara waalontha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [by] He who created the male and female"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اُس ذات کی جس نے نر اور مادہ کو پیدا کیا"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"92:4","textAr":"إِنَّ سَعۡيَكُمۡ لَشَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"Inna saAAyakum lashatta","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, your efforts are diverse"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"درحقیقت تم لوگوں کی کوششیں مختلف قسم کی ہیں"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"92:5","textAr":"فَأَمَّا مَنۡ أَعۡطَىٰ وَٱتَّقَىٰ","transliteration":"Faamma man aAAta waittaqa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"As for he who gives and fears Allah"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو جس نے (راہ خدا میں) مال دیا اور (خدا کی نافرمانی سے) پرہیز کیا"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"92:6","textAr":"وَصَدَّقَ بِٱلۡحُسۡنَىٰ","transliteration":"Wasaddaqa bialhusna","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And believes in the best [reward]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور بھلائی کو سچ مانا"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"92:7","textAr":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلۡيُسۡرَىٰ","transliteration":"Fasanuyassiruhu lilyusra","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"We will ease him toward ease"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اس کو ہم آسان راستے کے لیے سہولت دیں گے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"92:8","textAr":"وَأَمَّا مَنۢ بَخِلَ وَٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰ","transliteration":"Waamma man bakhila waistaghna","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But as for he who withholds and considers himself free of need"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جس نے بخل کیا اور (اپنے خدا سے) بے نیازی برتی"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"92:9","textAr":"وَكَذَّبَ بِٱلۡحُسۡنَىٰ","transliteration":"Wakaththaba bialhusna","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And denies the best [reward]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور بھلائی کو جھٹلایا"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"92:10","textAr":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلۡعُسۡرَىٰ","transliteration":"Fasanuyassiruhu lilAAusra","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"We will ease him toward difficulty"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اس کو ہم سخت راستے کے لیے سہولت دیں گے"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"92:11","textAr":"وَمَا يُغۡنِي عَنۡهُ مَالُهُۥٓ إِذَا تَرَدَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wama yughnee AAanhu maluhu itha taradda","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And what will his wealth avail him when he falls"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اُس کا مال آخر اُس کے کس کام آئے گا جبکہ وہ ہلاک ہو جائے؟"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"92:12","textAr":"إِنَّ عَلَيۡنَا لَلۡهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"Inna AAalayna lalhuda","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, [incumbent] upon Us is guidance"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"بے شک راستہ بتانا ہمارے ذمہ ہے"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"92:13","textAr":"وَإِنَّ لَنَا لَلۡأٓخِرَةَ وَٱلۡأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"Wainna lana lalakhirata waaloola","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And indeed, to Us belongs the Hereafter and the first [life]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور درحقیقت آخرت اور دنیا، دونوں کے ہم ہی مالک ہیں"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"92:14","textAr":"فَأَنذَرۡتُكُمۡ نَارٗا تَلَظَّىٰ","transliteration":"Faanthartukum naran talaththa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So I have warned you of a Fire which is blazing"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پس میں نے تم کو خبردار کر دیا ہے بھڑکتی ہوئی آگ سے"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"92:15","textAr":"لَا يَصۡلَىٰهَآ إِلَّا ٱلۡأَشۡقَى","transliteration":"La yaslaha illa alashqa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"None will [enter to] burn therein except the most wretched one"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس میں نہیں جھلسے گا مگر وہ انتہائی بد بخت"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"92:16","textAr":"ٱلَّذِي كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"Allathee kaththaba watawalla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Who had denied and turned away"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس نے جھٹلایا اور منہ پھیرا"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"92:17","textAr":"وَسَيُجَنَّبُهَا ٱلۡأَتۡقَى","transliteration":"Wasayujannabuha alatqa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But the righteous one will avoid it"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اُس سے دور رکھا جائیگا وہ نہایت پرہیزگار"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"92:18","textAr":"ٱلَّذِي يُؤۡتِي مَالَهُۥ يَتَزَكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Allathee yutee malahu yatazakka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[He] who gives [from] his wealth to purify himself"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو پاکیزہ ہونے کی خاطر اپنا مال دیتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"92:19","textAr":"وَمَا لِأَحَدٍ عِندَهُۥ مِن نِّعۡمَةٖ تُجۡزَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wama liahadin AAindahu min niAAmatin tujza","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And not [giving] for anyone who has [done him] a favor to be rewarded"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس پر کسی کا کوئی احسان نہیں ہے جس کا بدلہ اُسے دینا ہو"}]},{"ayah":20,"verseKey":"92:20","textAr":"إِلَّا ٱبۡتِغَآءَ وَجۡهِ رَبِّهِ ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ","transliteration":"Illa ibtighaa wajhi rabbihi alaAAla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But only seeking the countenance of his Lord, Most High"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ تو صرف اپنے رب برتر کی رضا جوئی کے لیے یہ کام کرتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":21,"verseKey":"92:21","textAr":"وَلَسَوۡفَ يَرۡضَىٰ","transliteration":"Walasawfa yarda","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And he is going to be satisfied"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور ضرور وہ (اُس سے) خوش ہوگا"}]}]}